  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> 使用 »mµFocus« 进行切削刃检测 — 0.1 微米的解决方案 </h1>",
   "body": "<p>»mµFocus« 可用于非接触式分析切削刃预准备和表面粗糙度。其在粗糙度检测中的分辨率可达 0.1 µm。</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/4/csm_muefocus_infodots_01_823d7f4cd6.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1340,
     "h": 840
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c1848",
   "bg": "white",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "",
   "body": "",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/9/csm_muefocus_anwendung_01_6748a607d4.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 399,
     "title": "只需一分钟",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>只需一分钟</h3> <p>»»mµFocus««能在约一分钟内采集所有用于 3D 可视化的图像数据。适用于抽样和批次的快速、精准测量周期。</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/7/csm_muefocus_anwendung_02_20dad0de12.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 399,
     "title": "仅限一台设备",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>仅限一台设备</h3> <p>»»mµFocus«« 致力于实现质量保证流程的高效化。配备 »»zep-R«« 传感器后，您只需一台设备即可检测切削边缘倒角和表面粗糙度。</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/f/csm_muefocus_anwendung_03_ca7082affd.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 399,
     "title": "仅在ZOLLER",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>仅在ZOLLER</h3> <p>»»mµFocus«« 的核心在于采用激光的非接触式传感器技术，并可选配共聚焦显微镜。该传感器系统由我们自主研发，仅在 ZOLLER 的设备中配备。</p> </figcaption>"
    }
   ],
